Description: keep Templates and Licenses out of the application folder
 Licenses are read from /system/data/Paladin/Licenses. Templates are
 edited by the user, so they live in the settings folder and are copied
 from /system/data/Paladin/Templates when missing.
Author: Numerio <b.vitruvio@gmail.com>
Forwarded: not-needed

